   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Working code gets you through the demo. Well-designed code survives change. LLD is\nthe skill of writing the second kind.",
   "originalText": "Working code gets you through the demo. Well-designed code survives change. LLD is\nthe skill of writing the second kind.",
