   "text": "Zoom: the whole system\n\nQuestion: how do the big pieces\nfit together?\n\nInstagram: servers, databases,\ncaches, load balancers, how one\nupload reaches millions of feeds\n\nInterview: 'Design Instagram for\n1 billion users'\n\nAsked to: mostly 2+ years\nexperience",
