   "text": "Principles are basic kitchen rules. Patterns are recipes. Problem\nmodeling is cooking a full dinner for 10 guests.",
   "originalText": "Principles are basic kitchen rules. Patterns are recipes. Problem\nmodeling is cooking a full dinner for 10 guests.",
