   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Readable: a new teammate\nunderstands it in 5\nminutes\n\nMaintainable: fixing a\nbug touches one place\n\nExtensible: a new feature\nmeans adding code, not\nediting old code\n\nTestable: each part can\nbe tested on its own",
   "originalText": "Readable: a new teammate\nunderstands it in 5\nminutes\n\nMaintainable: fixing a\nbug touches one place\n\nExtensible: a new feature\nmeans adding code, not\nediting old code\n\nTestable: each part can\nbe tested on its own",
