   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Instance field: every object has its own copy (orderId)\n• Static field: ONE copy shared by all objects\n   (orderCounter)\n• Call static things on the class: Order.getTotalOrders()\n• A static method has no this, so it can't use instance\n   fields\n• LLD uses: ID generators, constants, Math.max(),\n   Singleton (Lecture 8)",
   "originalText": "• Instance field: every object has its own copy (orderId)\n• Static field: ONE copy shared by all objects\n   (orderCounter)\n• Call static things on the class: Order.getTotalOrders()\n• A static method has no this, so it can't use instance\n   fields\n• LLD uses: ID generators, constants, Math.max(),\n   Singleton (Lecture 8)",
