   "text": "class Order {\n    private static int orderCounter = 0;\n    private int orderId;\n\n    Order() {\n        orderCounter++;\n        this.orderId = orderCounter;\n    }\n\n    static int getTotalOrders() {\n        return orderCounter;\n    }\n}",
   "originalText": "class Order {\n    private static int orderCounter = 0;\n    private int orderId;\n\n    Order() {\n        orderCounter++;\n        this.orderId = orderCounter;\n    }\n\n    static int getTotalOrders() {\n        return orderCounter;\n    }\n}",
