   "text": "Line A compiles: the list object itself can still change.\nLine B is a compile error: the variable can't point to a new list.\nfinal locks the reference (the arrow), not the object it points to.",
   "originalText": "Line A compiles: the list object itself can still change.\nLine B is a compile error: the variable can't point to a new list.\nfinal locks the reference (the arrow), not the object it points to.",
