   "text": "enum OrderStatus {\n    PLACED, PREPARING, OUT_FOR_DELIVERY,\n    DELIVERED, CANCELLED\n}\n\nOrderStatus status = OrderStatus.PLACED;\nstatus = OrderStatus.DELIVERD;  // compile error",
