   "text": "Every LLD problem has enums: VehicleType and\nSpotStatus (Parking Lot), SeatStatus\n(BookMyShow), Direction (Elevator),\nSplitType (Splitwise). If a value comes from\na fixed list, make it an enum.",
   "originalText": "Every LLD problem has enums: VehicleType and\nSpotStatus (Parking Lot), SeatStatus\n(BookMyShow), Direction (Elevator),\nSplitType (Splitwise). If a value comes from\na fixed list, make it an enum.",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
