   "text": "(a) Pizza size, (c) Payment mode and (e) Day of the week come from a fixed list, so\nthey are enums.\n(b) Customer name and (d) Order amount can be anything, so they stay String and\ndouble.",
   "originalText": "(a) Pizza size, (c) Payment mode and (e) Day of the week come from a fixed list, so\nthey are enums.\n(b) Customer name and (d) Order amount can be anything, so they stay String and\ndouble.",
