   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• model: the nouns, with their own rules (Wallet checks its\n   balance)\n• enums: fixed sets of values\n• service: actions that use several models (placing an order)\n• Main: wires everything together and runs the demo\n• Default access (no modifier) = visible only inside the same\n   package",
   "originalText": "• model: the nouns, with their own rules (Wallet checks its\n   balance)\n• enums: fixed sets of values\n• service: actions that use several models (placing an order)\n• Main: wires everything together and runs the demo\n• Default access (no modifier) = visible only inside the same\n   package",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
