   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. BankAccount: final account number from a static\n    counter, private balance, deposit() and\n    withdraw() with checks, AccountType enum\n    (SAVINGS, CURRENT) with a minimum balance.\n2. Student: auto-generated roll number, static\n    totalStudents, Grade enum.\n3. Put classes in model and enums packages. Write a\n    Main that creates 3 of each and prints them.",
